- ## 2. Execute Tool API
- POST https://agentearth.ai/agent-api/v1/tool/execute
- | Field      | Type   | Required | Description                                             |
- |------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------|
- | tool_name  | string | ✅        | Tool name, must match the one returned by recommend    |
